    <briefdescription>
<para>A Grow-Only Counter (G-Counter). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each participating node maintains its own monotonically increasing count. The total value is the sum of all per-node counts. Only the local node&apos;s count can be incremented. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
